    {"id": "h01", "at": 0.4,  "text": "What if adoption... was a game?", "caption": false},
    {"id": "h02", "at": 3.8,  "text": "Welcome to Digital City.", "caption": false},
    {"id": "h03", "at": 7.7,  "text": "Write the blueprint, and you claim your plot."},
    {"id": "h04", "at": 10.7, "text": "Take it live, and your building rises."},
    {"id": "h05", "at": 13.9, "text": "Use it, let A.I. build on it, and the lights come on."},
    {"id": "h06", "at": 17.9, "text": "Do it all, and you climb from traditional, to autonomous."},
    {"id": "h07", "at": 22.4, "text": "Every district sees its score: blueprints, usage, and A.I."},
    {"id": "h08", "at": 27.0, "text": "And healthy competition drives adoption."},
    {"id": "h09", "at": 29.8, "text": "Every brief that A.I. writes lights up a rooftop."},
